    {
      "id": "e6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Annual inspection per 14 CFR 91.409(a) and the scope and detail of 14 CFR Part 43 Appendix D, using the Cessna 172 inspection checklist."
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "ELT inspected per 14 CFR 91.207(d): installation, battery date, operation, and radiated signal."
    },
    {
      "id": "e8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Changed engine oil and filter. Compression check, cylinders 1 to 4: 77/80, 76/80, 71/80, 71/80."
    },
    {
      "id": "e9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Discrepancy: Corrosion on battery box. Corrective action: Removed corrosion, treated and painted battery box; neutralized battery area."
    },
    {
      "id": "e10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Aircraft found airworthy after correction of the discrepancies listed."
    },
